I wasn''t 100% positive this was yours during voting, so I didn''t want to comment until after rollover. But I just have to share that Beata was the first person to ever compare my work to yours--particularly in your shaping of light and tasteful use of distressed, vintage, and painterly textures. I think she would have loved seeing this photo on the front page of any challenge, but especially this one.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2026-07-17 10:38:13.</i></td>', 'I wasn''t 100% positive this was yours during voting, so I didn''t want to comment until after rollover. But I just have to share that Beata was the first person to ever compare my work to yours--particularly in your shaping of light and tasteful use of distressed, vintage, and painterly textures. I think she would have loved seeing this photo on the front page of any challenge, but especially this one.', '2026-07-17 10:37:46.000000', '2026-07-17 10:38:13.000000', 0),
(7827278, 1308678, 12200, '<td valign="top">
