(7827279, 1308583, 12200, '<td valign="top">
A beautiful capture, Larry. And a beautiful story, to match. On a personal note, the discoloration of the yarn on the ball--the black-brown instead of the typical distressed red--gave this tribute a mournful warmth that might be lost on others. I distinctly remember that, shortly before she took first place with that baseball image, Beata made a throwaway comment about how winning a blue ribbon here would really feel a major accomplishment for her.</td>', 'A beautiful capture, Larry. And a beautiful story, to match. On a personal note, the discoloration of the yarn on the ball--the black-brown instead of the typical distressed red--gave this tribute a mournful warmth that might be lost on others. I distinctly remember that, shortly before she took first place with that baseball image, Beata made a throwaway comment about how winning a blue ribbon here would really feel a major accomplishment for her.', '2026-07-17 10:56:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7827425, 1309262, 99263, '<td valign="top">
