<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2026-07-18 04:45:30.</i></td>', 'Lovely and very fitting', '2026-07-18 04:44:57.000000', '2026-07-18 04:45:30.000000', 0),
(7827486, 1309174, 274418, '<td valign="top">
Thank you for such nice words to everyone who commented. I truly appreciate it. My heart is shattered into million pieces and I have very dark thoughts. I''m not sure how I will survive this tragedy.  It''s been four weeks since she died and I still often can''t believe she is gone. I could use every friend I can find now and if you knew my sister, that''s even better. Please feel free to contact me anytime.
<br/>Grateful,
<br/>Aga</td>', 'Thank you for such nice words to everyone who commented. I truly appreciate it. My heart is shattered into million pieces and I have very dark thoughts. I''m not sure how I will survive this tragedy.  It''s been four weeks since she died and I still often can''t believe she is gone. I could use every friend I can find now and if you knew my sister, that''s even better. Please feel free to contact me anytime.
Grateful,
